Alan L. Cox writes:
 > Kris Kennaway wrote:
 > > 
 > > Dump of assembler code for function pmap_activate:
 > > 0xfffffc00005cf0b0 <pmap_activate>:     ldah    gp,14(t12)
 > ...
 > > 0xfffffc00005cf160 <pmap_activate+176>: srl     t1,0xd,t1
