166 MHz CPU
64MB RAM
2 or maybe 4 GB SCSI disk
board has 3 PCI slots, 1 open, 1 de nic (known to SRM), one tl nic. 
system has no vga, you must use the serial console, via laplink cable 
or similar.
system does not have optional cache fitted

system is in a AT/ATX midi tower case.

Can provide a biosless ata100 PCI controller if required.
Also have chips for cache if someone wants to install them.

